# Build context for containers/ (kc). Podman and Docker both read this file from
# the context root, which is the repo root so the render stage can see the chezmoi
# source. Allowlist: only the chezmoi source state and containers/ are sent.
# (chezmoi ignores dot-prefixed source files, so this never deploys to ~.)
*
!.chezmoi.toml.tmpl
!.chezmoiignore
!.chezmoiremove
!dot_*
!containers
